      "category": "economy",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Since 1977, Piedmont hosts an Ozark Heritage Fall Festival each mid‑October, drawing hundreds of visitors for music, crafts, and Ozark culture.",
